   - **Long-term fix:** Remove `scripts/checks/lib/ci2_runners.txt` from `wip/gate-scaling-determinism` so `ISS-0029` (`wip/repro-ci2`) is the single owner of both `repro_manifest_compare.py` and `ci2_runners.txt`, matching `scripts/checks/scheduled/README.md:13-23`.

